Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Journal and Host Protocol P1 Requirement Matrix

& [RequirementMatrix]
  + IAJ-01 pending valid genesis fixture
  + IAJ-02 pending deterministic event sequence fixture
  + IAJ-03 pending complete semantic replay fixture
